    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"period\" though. it feels like the end. i can see the trajectory. it's not just a slump, it's a permanent loss of whatever it was that made me special. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a total joke of a person. is there even any point in trying to fight something that's already decided?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
